div class=\"device-card__body\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Laser hair removal</p>\n          <h2 id=\"catalogue-cutera-title\">Cutera excel HR</h2>\n          <p class=\"device-card__summary\">Laser care with 755 nm and 1064 nm wavelength options. Learn about hair reduction and see the device at the clinic.</p>\n          <span class=\"device-card__link\"><span>Learn more</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"device-card\" href=\"/devices/finexel-fractional-co2\" aria-labelledby=\"catalogue-finexel-title\">\n        <div class=\"device-card__image\"><img src=\"/assets/videos/posters/finexel-fractional-co2.jpg\" alt=\"FineXel CO2\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n        <div class=\"device-card__body\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Fractional CO2 laser</p>\n          <h2 id=\"catalogue-finexel-title\">FineXel CO2</h2>\n          <p class=\"device-card__summary\">Fractional CO2 skin resurfacing. Read about texture, acne scars and recovery, and watch the clinic video.</p>\n          <span class=\"device-card__link\"><span>Learn more</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </div></div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section cta-band\">\n      <div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"cta-band__title\">Find the care you need.</h2><p class=\"cta-band__sub\">Tell us what you would like to improve. Our team will help you understand the options and confirm which branch offers the treatment.</p><div class=\"cta-band__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--gold\" href=\"/book\" data-open-booking>Book appointment</a></div></div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"container signature-footer-cta\"><h2>Your next step starts here.</h2><a class=\"btn btn--gold\" href=\"/book\" data-open-booking>Book appointment <svg class=\"btn__arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/></svg></a></div>\n\n    <div class=\"container footer__grid\">\n      <div class=\"footer__brand\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/images/logo-cream.png\" alt=\"Soie Clinic\" width=\"120\" height=\"114\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n        <p class=\"footer__tag\">Aesthetic care at Soie Clinic. Visit us in New Cairo or Mohandseen.</p>\n        <div class=\"footer__social\">\n          <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/soieclinic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Instagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"17.2\" cy=\"6.8\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></a>\n          <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/share/1LuwqRbLPB/?mibextid=wwXIfr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Facebook\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 8h2V5h-2c-2.2 0-3.5 1.3-3.5 3.6V11H8v3h2.5v7h3v-7H16l.5-3h-3V9c0-.7.3-1 1-1z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a>\n          <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/N7cUNHKMz3ZwnkaB7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Google Maps\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-6.2 7-12a7 7 0 10-14 0c0 5.8 7 12 7 12z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"cur